358
00:33:53.516 --> 00:33:54.809
I'm not fuckin' doing that.
You crazy?

359
00:33:54.892 --> 00:33:57.228
'Cause I can trust you,
but you can't trust me?

360
00:33:57.311 --> 00:33:58.938
Well, you shot the
fucking guy, man--

361
