377
00:37:51.379 --> 00:37:53.130
Well, do what you can.

378
00:37:53.214 --> 00:37:54.590
We gotta figure out a story.

379
00:37:56.509 --> 00:37:57.385
What happened?

380
00:37:58.594 --> 00:37:59.971
It...

381
00:38:04.183 --> 00:38:05.393
